  "details": "I've seen some major issues on driving worlds after the 2018 update. I also provided videos for evidence\n1. Collision detection seems to be worse ingame than in Unity: https://streamable.com/ky8twf\n2. You don't see animations on other people's cars or hear them: https://streamable.com/zysuer\nI've checked that No. 1 isn't a problem on the terrain mesh or the car's collision boxes, but it is the ingame collision detection. As for No. 2, I've already put the triggers to where they're suppose to be and tried different methods so the animations and sound would work but nothing worked.",
